\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {8}{\ignorespaces Median GPU latency vs.\ total energy per frame on a Jetson Orin NX 8\,GB (TensorRT fp16, 384$\times $384, batch 1, GPU compute only). Hollow markers: 15\,W; filled markers: MAXN; arrows link each model's two operating points, labels give FPS. The dash-dot line marks the 30\,Hz camera rate (33.3\,ms). The reparameterized FastViT-SA24 hybrid is fastest and most energy-efficient in both modes and is the only model that keeps up with the camera at 15\,W. Timings cover the frozen core only; module latency on the Orin has not yet been measured.\relax }}{10}{figure.caption.34}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:edge}{{8}{10}{Median GPU latency vs.\ total energy per frame on a Jetson Orin NX 8\,GB (TensorRT fp16, 384$\times $384, batch 1, GPU compute only). Hollow markers: 15\,W; filled markers: MAXN; arrows link each model's two operating points, labels give FPS. The dash-dot line marks the 30\,Hz camera rate (33.3\,ms). The reparameterized FastViT-SA24 hybrid is fastest and most energy-efficient in both modes and is the only model that keeps up with the camera at 15\,W. Timings cover the frozen core only; module latency on the Orin has not yet been measured.\relax }{figure.caption.34}{}}
